OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. A few
OL,7,Fscattered showers this morning, but
OL,8,Fthese dying out from the west during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThickening cloud will bring
OL,12,Fsome light and patchy rain from the
OL,13,Fwest this evening. Then the west will
OL,14,Fsee showery rain overnight, but dry
OL,15,Facross the east.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FCloud and rain will spread
OL,18,Fsoutheast during the morning, becoming
OL,19,Fdrier and eventually brighter during
OL,20,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
