OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,6,Ffor most of Wednesday but rain
OL,7,Fspreading northeast later. Bright
OL,8,Fspells and a few showers on Thursday.
OL,9,FShowers or longer spells of rain on
OL,10,FFriday.
